        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#FFF4DC;strokeColor=#C8A46E;fontSize=15;align=left;spacing=12;" value="&lt;b&gt;Recovery principles:&lt;/b&gt; Compute and storage locations are independent. PostgreSQL short-term cache loss is not durable data loss. Storage failover follows the configured replication policy. Regional relocation must respect tenant-approved regions and prevent concurrent writers. RPO/RTO and automatic versus operator-controlled relocation remain to be defined." vertex="1">
